### Local runtime artefacts ###
# Anchored to the SQLite directory on purpose: a bare "data/" also matches
# vendored directories such as node_modules/pdfkit/js/data, which silently
# strips pdfkit's .afm font metrics and breaks PDF report generation.
/backend/data/
trace.json
report.pdf

